|magicdesc=Official{{Ref|''Witch Hat Atelier'' Anime: [[Episode 1]] – [[Writing/Translated Texts#Intro Book]]}}
|magictype=Semi-directional}}
The '''Sign of Crushing''' crushes a target object into pieces. When paired with a sigil, '''Crushing''' will cause objects targeted by the spell and [[Wall Breaker Seal|disintegrate]] them, breaking them into smaller and smaller parts until they reach a sand-like or powdered state (if solid). the bigger the sign, the smaller the pieces that the targeted object would get crushed into.
If the sign is inverted and the spell is used on an already crushed substance, the crushed material will [[Integration|reform into its original shape]]. However, as soon as the spell wears off, or removed, the reformed object will return to its broken state.
